cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, cite the KUNTUR Competition v1.0 code release."
title: "KUNTUR Earth Observation Engines"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-11-15
type: software
authors:
  - name: "KUNTUR Project Team"
abstract: >-
  Research-stage software for quality-aware Earth observation time-series
  processing, robustness evaluation, external product comparison, and
  one-month regional temperature forecasting. Underlying satellite and
  station observations are not included.
